"ui.codex.survival_rule": "Survival: manual combat, experience collection, level-up choices, and a timed final boss.",
"ui.codex.survival_objects": "Teal beacons: approach and press F, then stay in the ring to purify. Heal 15% and choose an augment; purify all three to weaken the boss.\n\nOrange relics: dropped by milestone elites. Approach and press F to choose a survival augment.\n\nGolden exit: opens after the final boss. Press F to finish the adventure.",
