"content.evo_light_leap.description": "Teleport upward by {Effects.0.HeightMultiplier:0} times the base jump height and hover automatically for {Effects.0.HoverSeconds:0.0}s. Fall cooldown is reduced by {Effects.1.Tuning.CooldownReduction:0%}. Press the downward-attack key (Ctrl by default) to cancel hover.",
"content.wpn_spear.description": "A mid-range weapon with a four-hit combo and an instant straight spear throw. Sunset Afterglow displays a landing marker and a selection radius of {FallAttackAim.AimRadiusHeightRatio:0} times the height above ground; dive speed increases by {FallAttackAim.DiveSpeedBonus:0%}.",
